  "review_findings": [
    "All seven reviewed source/builder files exactly equal the prior reviewed files after only resume4-to-resume5 scope, fresh inspector directory and actual owner/observer source pins are replaced; no algorithm, resource, lifecycle, readiness or diagnostic-result semantics changed.",
    "Observer remains independently detached outside the inspector descendant tree; it reads selected receipt-anchored identity/genealogy metadata and never signals, reaps, ptraces, stops, or mutates observed processes.",
    "Discovery interval, selected-process sampling/burst, launch wait, overall deadline, identity/output/read caps, explicit sampling/read gaps and compact final fallback are unchanged.",
    "Fresh installation has exact inventory and owner source binding, bounded canonical root-owned input reads, O_NOFOLLOW/exclusive writes, fresh output/launch/log checks, reservation receipt and exact source readback. The seven commands only install the two sources.",
    "Final projection retains missing-versus-empty forced-descendant semantics, explicit coverage limits and selected metadata scope; diagnostic exit cannot supply inspection acceptance.",
    "Actual preflight constants remain None and runtime-binding is absent. The additive finalizer still requires a separately observed accepted resume5 preflight, changes only the two ready-preflight constants, and preserves the original templates. Final runtime release must link the binding to reviewed physical evidence."
  ],
